 smallest fix that stays on the 2.x line, which avoids 3.x API changes.\n- **Branch:** `fix/cve-2026-31337-fastjson-2.9.4`. The one commit (a7ffe29fb7) changes the version in `requirements.txt` and adds an entry to `CHANGELOG.md`.\n- **CI:** run `ci-0001` passed.\n- **Pull request:** #101 (https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101). When I opened it, the reviewer list came back empty, so I requested alex separately and that went through.\n\nI haven't merged it. Merging into main needs a code owner's approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}